    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d472">

                <pb facs="0547" n="487" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg487"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Runyon to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Stern’s Munich attorney writes me Bavarian legal authorities will inquire into
                    the necessity for so long postponement through German consul New York.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Runyon</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
